WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.400
The transcript, with the point on the first heading

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:06.900
In the transcript, press - to fold everything

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:09.900
Press 2, then 3, to open one level at a time

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:12.500
Press n to move from heading to heading

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:15.100
Press TAB to fold and unfold one node

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:17.000
Press + to unfold everything
